  m_text: '1.  Read the mission goal: land your rocket below the maximum landing
    speed.


    2.  Build a flight program from blocks (Launch, Boost, Wait) in
    the programming panel.


    3.  Run the program and watch your fuel, speed and
    height.


    4.  Touch down gently on the target. Too fast and the landing fails,
    so adjust and try again.'
